    <!-- German (de). Du, not Sie. Effort / Charge / strain / WHOOP / NOOP stay untranslated; HR reads
         HF in compounds and columns, workout reads Workout (as in nav_workouts) and session reads
         Einheit, the app-wide term. The three heart-rate metric slots carry the full name
         (Herzfrequenz / Mittlere Herzfrequenz / Max. Herzfrequenz). The range words carry their own demonstrative
         ("diese Woche", "diesen Monat") and the range captions stay case-neutral, so every sentence
         that embeds one is built without a governing preposition and stays grammatical. -->

